0 @N1986@ NOTE This index does not contain lists of births from New York City. Ne
1 CONC w York City is considered to be a separate vital records jurisdiction fr
1 CONC om the rest of New York state, and consequently the city has its own bir
1 CONC th indices. However, a small number of New York City birth listings ar
1 CONC e found throughout this index. This is due to the births happening in to
1 CONC wns that were previously independent before the consolidation of the cit
1 CONC y in 1898 (for example, a pre-1898 birth in a place like Canarsie [Brook
1 CONC lyn] or Flushing [Queens] might be listed here) or because there was a l
1 CONC ate birth registration.
