1 CONC k and efforts of Reclaim the Records.
0 @N2024@ NOTE Deaths have been officially recorded in New Zealand since 1848, an
1 CONC d were originally under the jurisdiction of the Colonial Secretary. A la
1 CONC w in 1913 required that Mäori deaths also be registered, and these recor
1 CONC ds were part of a separate registration system until 1961. The records i
1 CONC n this collection are provided by the New Zealand Department of Interna
1 CONC l Affairs.
